{"reviewId": "363182609_842lojvHS", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "1.康波的本质：一代人（从成年到退休）约 50 年。他们的价值观、风险偏好、消费习惯、技术能力决定了一个时代的经济形态。康波周期 ≈ 一代人的经济行为周期。\n2.每一代人接棒后，都会用自己的技术与信念重塑经济结构。因此，代际更迭既是技术创新的根源，也是经济波动的根源。\n3.康波的形成，是人类集体心理与行为周期的物质化。当一代人从贫穷走向富足，他们的欲望、恐惧、信念与制度共同塑造了经济的节奏。当他们老去，新一代带着新的技术和心智登场，新的周期便由此开始。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "康波的形成是人的集体行为的结果，而这种集体行为取决于人的代际更迭。", "range": "953-986", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "363182609_842lojvHS", "userVid": 363182609, "topics": [], "createTime": 1760940502, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 363182609, "name": "       ", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0019-rbxn9E6mTegMEgduo2tQe10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 63, "likes": [{"userVid": 63311112, "name": "颜枫", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/0K42d2gvYoCBeiaE17obPiawNpRJE0QTzunWZHWJBfelfk3xdxOGCIPwQ75etPLKCBfD2qRzRN3VsyOOX9MFAJTHfBM9rCiaZhkZCrZfoWmWvA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "颜枫", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-B-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "363182609_842lojvHS", "content": "那